  "explanation": "The original sources consistently identify General Seitz (John A. 'Andy' Seitz) as holding the rank of Brigadier General. This is directly stated in D1S2 and D2S4, where it explicitly mentions 'Brigadier General John \"Andy\" Andrew Seitz.' Other documents reference 'Lieutenant General' and 'Major General,' but these refer to other individuals named Seitz (e.g., Richard J. Seitz and John F. R. 'Jeff' Seitz). These are distinct referents and should not be conflated with the subject of the question, General Seitz."
